" >The goals of the game vary per level: try racing stunt courses, solve physics puzzles, simply chill on the stage... the possibilities are endless with Steam Workshop support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/0a0cf27560725167ecb4ed7c024daa41.poster.avif?t=1753723796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/0a0cf27560725167ecb4ed7c024daa41.webm?t=1753723796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/0a0cf27560725167ecb4ed7c024daa41.mp4?t=1753723796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with his friends by his side, Mr. Dismount never has to feel alone again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/6700ac84f35d431cd35444c39460f3e6.poster.avif?t=1753723796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/6700ac84f35d431cd35444c39460f3e6.webm?t=1753723796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280350/extras/6700ac84f35d431cd35444c39460f3e6.mp4?t=1753723796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
